g in, or toggling item stock is reflected on both sides instantly.\n3. **Paytm Soundbox Simulator:** Turn your system volume up! The kitchen dashboard will announce new tokens, cooking states, and collection alerts out loud (*\"Token 101 is ready for collection!\"*).\n4. **UPI Network Timeout Simulation:** Tapping \"Pay via UPI\" simulates a common range failure inside metal canteen roofs, offering a prompt to bypass using pre-loaded **Canteen Wallet** funds.\n5. **Arrive-to-Cook & Offline Tokens:** Scheduled orders pause until you check in, preventing food from getting cold. A secure, cached offline QR code token allows collection even with zero network coverage.\n\nFor a detailed review of code structures, design tokens, and components, please check the [walkthrough.md](file:///C:/Users/Raja/.gemini/antigravity/brain/87192ae7-7d6d-48fb-83ac-9f3e8c5c6d95/walkthrough.md). Let me know how the presentation goes or if you want to extend this further!"}
